
DialogID_75504=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have one in my hand, please take a look.</font>
DialogID_75508=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Here, take this whistle</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >! In times of danger, blow it</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, and I</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > will find a way to rescue you! Remember, only use it in dire emergencies! For now, I have other matters to attend to, so I must go!</font>
DialogID_75511=<font face="Default" color="#ed123e" >(Just climbed over the dirt pile)</font>
DialogID_75513=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >A wise person knows the current situation and acts accordingly. I have taken your belongings and will not mistreat you.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have some news for you, there will be a mysterious conference at Tianyi Valley.</font>
DialogID_75519=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Here is what you wanted, take it.</font>
DialogID_75520=
DialogID_75522=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >My friend, have you found anything?</font>
DialogID_75526=<font face="Default" color="#ef002f" >(The warehouse manager who was burned to death)</font>
DialogID_75530=<font face="Default" color="#fc0717" >(These boxes seem to be full)</font>
DialogID_75533=<font face="Default" color="#ff050d" >(The mine that was destroyed by an explosion)</font>
DialogID_75534=
DialogID_75536=
QiecuoMenu_75502=<font face="Default" color="#ff051e" >（This girl is not only domineering herself, but her subordinates are also sharp-tongued!）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >If you don't agree, let's settle it with our fists!</font>
QiecuoMenu_75504=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'm sorry if I offend you.</font>
QiecuoMenu_75505=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Respect is better than obedience, sorry for offending.</font>
QiecuoMenu_75507=<font face="Default" color="#ff0718" >(It seems to be someone from the Qin Palace...)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have important matters to attend to, I have no interest in the Qin Palace, please make way.</font>
QiecuoTitle_75502=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Do you want to take a look in the mirror? You? You dare to make our big sister your subordinate?</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You're quite bold!</font>
QiecuoTitle_75504=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It seems you're convinced that I have the fragment on me, but I will never give in! Take this!</font>
QiecuoTitle_75505=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hmph! That sounds nice! This is just blatant robbery, if you have the ability, beat me first!</font>
QiecuoTitle_75507=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Please stay! We have been waiting for you for a long time. Come with me to meet the King of Qin.</font>
