okmenu_75504=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Wow! How lucky... </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >chess piece </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >is exactly the same as the one I just picked up. </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font>
okmenu_75508=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >So cunning, just said they would help me and then ran away after throwing a whistle under my feet </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font>
okmenu_75511=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Well done, Juhua! </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You really found something. </font>
okmenu_75513=<font face="Default" color="#ff0720" >(It's supposed to be appreciation...but it's just blatant robbery...looks like we won't be getting our pieces back)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Your Highness</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >for informing us</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
okmenu_75519=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you.</font>
okmenu_75520=
okmenu_75522=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I found this mask near the armory, along with this black powder, which seems to be a highly powerful explosive...</font>
okmenu_75526=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oh no, the lead is lost again! It seems that someone is watching us from the shadows, always one step ahead of us.</font>
okmenu_75530=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This powder is...</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Batiang Lei (a type of explosive)!</font>
okmenu_75533=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This is bad! We're too late! The mine has already been destroyed! Hurry to the mine on the north side of the city!</font>
okmenu_75534=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank goodness, we made it! The mine is safe and sound!</font>
okmenu_75536=<font face="Default" color="#f90c1c" >Remove the fuse.</font>
story_75501_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Forego formalities, you arrive at the perfect time. There are important guests from afar in the palace, and their identities are quite special...</font>
story_75501_2=<font face="Default" color="#fc0213" >(with a look of admiration in his eyes)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >truly have extraordinary experience and intelligence</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'm sure you have also heard of it, I am not the king's son...more than thirty years ago, the king brought me back from the secret cult to be raised in the Qin palace...it has been over thirty years since I have seen anyone from the secret cult</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
story_75501_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Initially, </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >my father, the king, named me Zhu Jing, but the names given by the Zhu family follow the principles of Yin and Yang and the Five Elements. As a member of the fifth generation, my name should contain the radical for the element of fire. In the end, my father was still wary of me, and I could never become a legitimate member of the royal family...</font>
story_75502_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Indeed... The few disciples of the Holy Esoteric Sect seem to have very different appearances from those of the Central Plains. Although the sect has grown and flourished in foreign lands, it originated from the martial arts of the Central Plains, and its disciples are all from the Central Plains. Therefore, I cannot understand why the Holy Envoy and his entourage behaved without any mistakes.</font>
story_75502_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Right now, it's just the two of us. </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Miss, </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >you can speak freely.</font>
story_75502_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's strange, one of the rules of the secret sect is that</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >only Han Chinese disciples are accepted, and no outsiders are allowed to infiltrate. So why are there now</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >outsider disciples here?</font>
story_75503_1=<font face="Default" color="#f20c3a" >(Furrowed brow)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hmm...</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This is a good wine</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font>
story_75503_2=<font face="Default" color="#ff0019" >(Rubbing hands secretly)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >And...it's not bad...</font>
story_75504_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Could it be...these people</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >are actually people from Ku Yi?</font>
story_75505_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Those who are not of our clan must be disloyal. I was born into Esoteric Buddhism, and the first doctrine that Esoteric Buddhism advocates is to ensure the purity of the Chinese bloodline. I, the king, will never violate this doctrine and will not seek to gain power through the help of foreign barbarians.</font>
story_75505_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Now, Esoteric Buddhism has set up a series of shocking conspiracies, colluding with barbarians, and intending to destroy the Great Ming... It seems that Esoteric Buddhism has long been on guard against us. The top experts we sent out have yet to gain any results...</font>
story_75506_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hello, my friend,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >you have finally arrived. Since our last game of chess, I have been feeling quite unsatisfied with my loss. Today, shall we have another game?</font>
story_75506_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oh, what a pity! I had planned to have you stay for a few days, to enjoy some tea, drinks, and chess. But just now, I received an urgent message from the leader, summoning you back for an important matter.</font>
story_75507_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have been waiting here on behalf of the leader, as per his orders.</font>
story_75507_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This matter must be traced back to a chess piece... In recent times, there have been several disputes and fights in the martial arts world, and surprisingly, it is a few small chess pieces that have caused these martial artists to fight each other. Although these chess pieces are exquisitely crafted and rare, they should not cause such a big commotion...</font>
story_75508_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'm also worried about this matter. Although a chess piece may seem insignificant, it may trigger a major upheaval... Recently, there have been turbulent undercurrents in the south, and suspicious individuals often appear in the martial arts world. I hope that you can assist me in investigating this matter.</font>
story_75508_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Coincidentally, my fourth disciple, Xie Ruoning, who was out, has returned. You can go to the inn to find her.</font>
story_75509_1=<font face="Default" color="#fc051d" >(There was a hint of disdain and provocation in his eyes)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Did your master send you? Let's make things clear beforehand! I don't want to be someone's errand girl. I have always been fair, and I speak with my fists</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >and wisdom</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >! How about this, let's compete first</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'll tell you a place</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >we'll split up and track</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >those</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >suspicious</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >people</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Whoever finds useful clues first will be the</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >leader</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, and the other person will obediently</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >be a follower</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
story_75510_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, young hero... I, Xie Ruoning, have always been fair and will repay any kindness. From now on, you will be my leader and I will assist you in the investigation.</font>
story_75511_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >There is a village called Biluocun on the outskirts of Suzhou, where people make a living by</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >picking tea</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >. Recently, strange things have been happening in Biluocun</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font>
story_75512_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Lately, strange things have been happening in the village... Everyone is scared and has no desire to pick tea.</font>
story_75512_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You are really kind-hearted. Speaking of which, our village has always been peaceful and the people in the village have always been harmonious. Until recently, there have been three strange incidents in the village...</font>
story_75512_3=In our village, there is a young widow named June. Speaking of this June, she is beautiful but has bad luck. However, she has a cheerful personality and always greets people with a smile. She has a good relationship with the women in the village and often takes them to dance in the fields while planting rice. Some of the older men in the village have their eyes on June, but she always keeps her distance and never crosses the line. However, recently June suddenly fell ill and the women in the village say she is faking it. Some people have even seen her sneaking into different men's houses... Now these rumors are getting more and more exaggerated, causing chaos in the village. Many couples are fighting and there are frequent visits to me for mediation because of this June.
story_75512_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The second strange thing is even more surprising. Our 80-year-old neighbor, Mr. Yu, suddenly gained divine power and killed a vicious dog with one hand a few days ago.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The third thing is that the village idiot, Yao Er, has started speaking in a strange manner, constantly talking about righteousness and morality, even more so than the only scholar in the village. He is now talkative and knowledgeable, causing a stir among the villagers and making them anxious.</font>
story_75513_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Do you still want to pretend you don't know? Tell us the truth! Everyone in the village knows that there are ghosts in our village!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Now, some people have been possessed by ghosts and are not acting normally. It is said that they won't live for more than three days. Please save us!</font>
story_75514_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Woof woof...</font>
story_75515_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >A human skin mask? A few strands of hair... </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > grew up in the foreign land, and I am quite familiar with the way these hair strands are tied, it seems to have a great connection with esoteric Buddhism. </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >There is a force called esoteric Buddhism in the foreign land, although it has developed there for several years, it originated from the Central Plains, and all the disciples of esoteric Buddhism are of Han Chinese descent. </font>
story_75515_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Young hero, the clues you have found are crucial, Miss Xie will continue to investigate. Do you remember the chess piece from before? I and Master Lin have secretly studied it, and there is something suspicious inside the chess piece, each piece contains a fragment, which seems to be part of a painting... </font>
story_75516_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What fragment? I... I haven't heard of it! If you follow me, don't blame me for being ruthless! </font>
story_75517_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >How did you know? </font>
story_75518_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What do these two lines on the painting mean? </font>
story_75518_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yunyan</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > Pavilion? So this is a hidden message... </font>
story_75519_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >No need for formalities, are you in a hurry, do you have something to discuss?</font>
story_75519_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Haha, truly a hero among young people, with a keen eye. I did not misjudge, but this diagram involves the fate of the world and is closely related to the lives of the people of the Great Ming. Therefore, the road ahead is extremely dangerous, and if you decide to get involved, there is a possibility of risking your life. I will give you some time to think it over. If you have made up your mind, you can come to me in five days to investigate this diagram thoroughly.</font>
story_75520_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The prince wants you to go, will you dare not obey? You really don't know your place. To be honest, even if you defeat me, it will be useless. We still have a large number of experts hiding nearby. I advise you to come with us to avoid unnecessary conflict.</font>
story_75521_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >A straightforward person, I don't need to beat around the bush. I heard you obtained a set of chess pieces, and this prince has always enjoyed collecting famous chess sets from all over the world. Therefore, I want to see it for myself.</font>
story_75522_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff0213" >(The index and middle fingers of the master's hands are tightly intertwined)</font>
story_75523_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Because the map points to Yunyan Pavilion, the leader and my master sent me here, but unfortunately... when I arrived, the pavilion master had already met with an unfortunate fate... I discovered the pavilion master's hint, so I jumped into the well. I didn't expect... that you would also come so soon.</font>
story_75523_2=<font face="Default" color="#ff050d" >(Expression becomes increasingly serious)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >There is a chess game here...</font>
story_75524_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Please return to Suzhou first, as Master Lin may have something to entrust to you. I have already sent a message to Master Lin and </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >the master</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, informing them of everything that has happened here at the Cloud Cliff Pavilion. I need to stay here to remove the gesture made by the Lord of the Pavilion before his death, and to properly bury him. I will return to Suzhou later to meet with you.</font>
story_75525_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have heard about the tragic massacre at the Cloud Cliff Pavilion... Currently, the situation is critical. It is said that one or more foreign forces are secretly gathering together, seemingly planning something that is extremely detrimental to the Ming Dynasty. The Japanese force have been very active in the Suzhou area recently. Please go to Ruoning to inquire about the specific information.</font>
story_75526_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Please don't joke with me, I have already heard from my master about your purpose for coming. Hurry and go to the Murong family to investigate, Murong Qianqiu has been secretly communicating with the Japanese and it's very suspicious... Also, I warn you! Don't go near the Salt Gang, that is where only I can investigate! If you go near the Salt Gang, hmph! I guarantee you won't be able to leave unscathed!</font>
story_75527_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Young friend, have you made any new discoveries?</font>
story_75527_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you for your hard work, Danxu and Ruoning have also found many clues. The Japanese are just a small part of this conspiracy, the real intention behind them is to find the dragon veins of the Ming Dynasty.</font>
story_75528_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oh, people have been in a state of panic recently. The court suddenly took action to suppress and eliminate the martial arts sects. The Wuzhu Mountain Villa and the Jiangnan Thunderbolt Hall were both raided and destroyed.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Among them, the Jiangnan Thunderbolt Hall was hit the hardest.</font>
story_75528_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The Jiangnan Thunderbolt Hall is the largest branch of the Thunderbolt Hall, and all of the unique gunpowder in the Thunderbolt Hall is produced by the Jiangnan Thunderbolt Hall. This time, the Jiangnan Thunderbolt Hall was accused of treason and was destroyed by the court. The Tangmen and Thunderbolt Hall dare not rashly intervene, for fear of being implicated and causing more trouble.</font>
story_75529_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I... I am the youngest daughter of the Jiangnan Lei family, Lei Yu... Young hero, please save me! My parents have already died unjustly... sob... I am the only one who managed to escape... sob...</font>
story_75530_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The Jiangnan Leis were accused of treason and were exterminated by the court. Hundreds of people from the Lei family were executed and all of their property was confiscated. The head of the Lei family and his wife also died tragically. Alas, how tragic! The court's actions were swift and ruthless, and I was unable to intervene... </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I wonder</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > where the orphaned children of the Lei family are now?</font>
story_75530_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will send more people to protect Miss Lei and ensure her safety. I am still puzzled by the massacre of the Lei family. As far as I know, the Lei family has close ties with the court in the south and has been producing a large number of firearms for the military office, profiting greatly from it. However, they have now fallen to the fate of being wiped out. A few days ago, I received a secret letter from the Dongfang Manor Lord, informing me that several disciples of the Lei family were saved by the Dongfang family and are now hiding there. I ask that you go to the Dongfang family on my behalf to understand the situation.</font>
story_75531_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have received a message from the leader through a carrier pigeon and I am aware of your intentions. The Lei family has been relying on the support of the court for these years and may have become arrogant, but to accuse them of treason is baseless. Several surviving disciples of the Thunderbolt Hall were recently rescued by Ling Shao and are currently hiding in the armory.</font>
story_75531_2=They are currently in the armory in the backyard, you can go there yourself.
story_75532_1=<font face="Default" color="#f90421" >(Focus and look closely)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >These black powders should be the exclusive gunpowder left behind by the Thunderbolt Hall's powerful Thunderbolt Explosion. The Thunderbolt Explosion has immense power and when it explodes, it will blast in all directions, leaving no room for escape. And the mask you found</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, although it has a simple style, is made of a special metal material</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, which is why it remains intact in the explosion.</font>
story_75532_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Things are getting more and more complicated, and the disciples of the Thunderbolt Hall in the arsenal</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >have all</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >been killed in the explosion. Now, it will be difficult to uncover the truth...</font>
story_75533_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff0724" >(Terrified)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You...you saw it too? Oh no, it's so scary! That big rat must be a demon in disguise! It is said that the rat comes out every night to eat people, and it is impervious to weapons!</font>
story_75534_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff052a" >(Muttering)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >When the monkey appears, there will be great calamity for the country! As recorded in the "Classic of Mountains and Seas", thirty miles to the east lies the Yidi Mountain, where there is abundant jade on top and gold below. There is a beast, resembling a weasel with white ears and beak, called the monkey. Its appearance signifies the arrival of a great army in the country.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oh, the situation is not peaceful at all!</font>
story_75535_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Now everyone is afraid of being eaten by the monster. At night, we must not go out.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Ah!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >!</font>
story_75536_1=<font face="Default" color="#f9040d" >(Quite shocked)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Can we find out who is responsible for this?</font>
story_75536_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have always been on good terms with the head of the village, so I will do my best to protect the Dongfang family.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Let's put this matter aside for now. I want to ask you something. Have you heard any strange rumors since you arrived in Yanjing City?</font>
story_75536_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have also heard about this matter. The talk of ghosts and monsters is foolish and absurd! I have sent the gods from the Six Departments to investigate, and you can also go and ask her for information about the white mouse.</font>
story_75537_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oh, it's good to see you again! So you are the helper that the Han king mentioned! I heard that you saw the white mouse last night?</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Take me to the scene and let me see.</font>
story_75538_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >These people must have practiced the art of shrinking their bones, so they can hide in these specially made giant rat</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >skins</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, using them to deceive and trick people.</font>
story_75538_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >We will first leave this place. I have investigated the identities of the merchants who were rumored to have been "eaten" by giant rats in the city. These merchants all have one thing in common - most of them are not from the central plains and have long-term business dealings with foreign lands.</font>
story_75539_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This gunpowder is the Thunderbolt Hall's tyrant thunder... Strange! The gunpowder of Thunderbolt Hall has long been confiscated by the imperial court and handed over to the Metropolitan Police Department. How did it end up in the market? Initially, Thunderbolt Hall was accused of murdering the Right Imperial Historian of the Metropolitan Police Department. It seems that there is some connection between this matter and the Metropolitan Police Department. I know a person named Mu Wei, who is the keeper of the warehouse in the Metropolitan Police Department. You can go and ask him first.</font>
story_75540_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Are you the one sent by the God-catcher to come here?</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Respectful greetings! To be honest, the gunpowder that was confiscated from the warehouse of the detective office has been regularly taken away recently, and there is not much left in the warehouse.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >According to regulations, records must be kept for the storage and removal of gunpowder,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You can go take a look.</font>
story_75541_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Now the warehouse has been burned, and it is impossible to know who and when the gunpowder of the Thunderbolt Hall was taken out. Now there is only one way left</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >! </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I guess they</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, since they need a large amount of gunpowder, must find a way to transport it out of the city. If we check the recent situation of carriages leaving the city at the city gate, we may find some</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > gains</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >! </font>
story_75542_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Don't worry! I am not a bad person, but my identity is special and cannot be explained in a few words. There is danger lurking here, so let's leave this place with me first.</font>
story_75543_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >To be honest, I am the third prince of the Wala Kingdom, Saihan. Since the defeat of the Yuan Dynasty and the death of our ancestors on the battlefield, we have been forced to retreat to the grasslands of the north. Over the years, we have had a great regret left in the Central Plains. Our ancestors' remains are still here. This time, I risked coming to Yanjing to find our ancestors' remains in the Purple Gold Ridge.</font>
story_75543_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Our ancestors' remains should be in the mine ahead,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >would you be willing</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >to come with me to take a look?</font>
story_75544_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >These masked individuals are likely from the Ku Yi tribe, who have distinct features from those of the Central Plains people. Their noses are sunken and their nostrils are small, which can seem out of place with their large faces. Therefore, the Ku Yi people like to wear masks to conceal their unique appearance. They have suddenly appeared here, so be careful, young hero! I have been staying in the Central Plains for several days now, and since I have found my ancestors' remains, I must immediately return to the Wa La tribe.</font>
story_75545_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >These</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >wretched</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >miners</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >! They were transporting gunpowder from the Duzhacisi to use in blasting mines. Additionally, I discovered that</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >it was</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >the Duzhacisi's Left Imperial Historian, Li Guangming, who reported to the Emperor that the Jiangnan Thunderbolt Hall was plotting rebellion</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The Right Imperial Historian's</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >death is very suspicious</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >and it is likely that Li Guangming is involved!</font>
story_75546_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Now, we only have one day left!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's not easy to find all the mines in Yanjing.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It seems that I need to quickly report to the King of Han and request for more troops to search.</font>
story_75547_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thanks to you, the million people in Yanjing City were spared from disaster. I have already reported this matter truthfully to the Emperor.</font><font face="Default" color="#ff0515" >(Suddenly looks at you with deep meaning)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You must be wondering why I never ask about your past?</font>
story_75547_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >We won't mention your past for now. Li Guangming has already confessed to all his crimes and has been thrown into prison. The wise and brave emperor has already cleared the name of the Thunderbolt Hall in Jiangnan. The Dongfang Family has only been reprimanded for their negligence this time. Do you know that you have achieved great merit? The ore found in the mine is a precious tungsten ore that can be used to create indestructible weapons. The court has already sent people to guard it for future mining.</font>
story_75547_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You are facing adversity, but you have repeatedly overcome it with amazing perseverance. I greatly appreciate you! Today, I am feeling a bit tired</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font><font face="Default" color="#ff050d" >(The Han King suddenly changes his expression and waves his hand, saying)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Guards, take this person away!</font>
story_75548_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Earlier, there were many people around and it was not convenient to speak openly. The first time I saw you, I already knew that you were the wanted criminal who murdered the princess and her husband. However, this time you have performed a great deed and saved the people from danger. In order to show our appreciation, the court has temporarily lifted the wanted order. You have one year to find the real culprit and prove your innocence. Otherwise, after one year, the wanted order will be reinstated.</font>
story_menu_75501=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Your Highness, it's been a long time since we last met...</font>
story_menu_75502=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Your Highness, may I introduce the envoy? Have you noticed anything?</font>
story_menu_75503=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Envoy, you have come from afar. I wonder if you are accustomed to drinking this Du Kang wine?</font>
story_menu_75504=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Your Highness, there is deception in this matter...</font>
story_menu_75505=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Your Highness, although the people of Ku Yi are not Han Chinese, they are weak and not worth worrying about...</font>
story_menu_75506=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Master, it's been a while since we last met. How have you been?</font>
story_menu_75507=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Huh? Brother Zhang, why are you here?</font>
story_menu_75508=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Greetings, Master. I have heard from Brother Zhang about the matter of the chess pieces...</font>
story_menu_75509=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Miss, may I ask if you are Xie Ruoning, the fourth disciple of the Master?</font>
story_menu_75510=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Miss Xie. If I hadn't saved you just now, I'm afraid things would have turned out for the worse.</font>
story_menu_75511=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Is there anything suspicious in this area? Please tell me the truth.</font>
story_menu_75512=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Village Chief, I am here to buy tea leaves. Do you have any Biluochun for sale?</font>
story_menu_75513=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Why are you all so panicked?</font>
story_menu_75514=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Guliu, my dear chrysanthemum, what have you discovered?</font>
story_menu_75515=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The village of Bilu</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > is indeed strange. Brother Zhang, take a look at this</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >thing.</font>
story_menu_75516=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Excuse me, sir</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, let's not beat around the bush. Do you have a piece of chess fragment in your hand?</font>
story_menu_75517=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >But</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > Brother Hu? I heard you have a piece of chess fragment in your hand.</font>
story_menu_75518=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The picture has a</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > sentence written on it: "Yunqi does not climb the pavilion, the rocks wear the mountains and rivers."</font>
story_menu_75519=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Pavilion Master,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > I apologize for coming uninvited and causing trouble.</font>
story_menu_75520=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This seems to be never-ending, it seems difficult to get away...</font>
story_menu_75521=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Greetings, Your Majesty. May I ask why you have invited me with such "enthusiasm"?</font>
story_menu_75522=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >(Looking at the body of the Lord of the Pavilion)</font>
story_menu_75523=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Brother Zhang</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >! Why are you here?</font>
story_menu_75524=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What are your plans, Brother Zhang?</font>
story_menu_75525=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Greetings, Leader Lin...</font>
story_menu_75526=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Big Sister, are you well?</font>
story_menu_75527=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Leader Lin,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have returned...</font>
story_menu_75528=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Along the way, I heard about the court's suppression and crackdown on martial arts sects. I inquired further and found out...</font>
story_menu_75529=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Who is this young lady? Why are the soldiers chasing her all the way?</font>
story_menu_75530=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >There are still people alive in the Jiangnan Lei family...</font>
story_menu_75531=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Regarding the incident of the Jiangnan Thunder Hall being raided and wiped out...</font>
story_menu_75532=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >About the masks and black powder...</font>
story_menu_75533=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >A huge white rat appeared in the city of Yanjing, and rumors spread...</font>
story_menu_75534=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >That white rat...</font>
story_menu_75535=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It must be a monster, so strange...</font>
story_menu_75536=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yesterday, the Dongfang Family's arsenal was destroyed by gunpowder...</font>
story_menu_75537=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have come to investigate the clues of the white rat on behalf of the Han King.</font>
story_menu_75538=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Unexpectedly, there is another world in this giant rat, and it can hide so many killers.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >!</font>
story_menu_75539=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I found some black</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" ></font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >gunpowder.</font>
story_menu_75540=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Some black gunpowder was found near the market shops, which is the Ba Tian Lei made by the Jiangnan Thunderbolt Hall.</font>
story_menu_75541=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The warehouse suddenly flooded, and the guards were burned to death.</font>
story_menu_75542=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Who are you?</font>
story_menu_75543=<font face="Default" color="#fc050d" >(It turns out that the black-clothed person just now was actually a Wala person!)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You are not from the Central Plains! What is your purpose for infiltrating Yanjing?</font>
story_menu_75544=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's another explosion from the Thunderbolt Hall...</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Who are those masked people?</font>
story_menu_75545=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >In the cave</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >there are many</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >masked people from the bitter city, they secretly take the purple gold ore from the Purple Gold Ridge and continuously transport the Thunderbolt Hall's gunpowder</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >to the mines.</font>
story_menu_75546=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I saw many</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >boxes</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >in the mine at Purple Mountain, and if these</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >boxes</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >were filled with Thunderbolt Hall's black gunpowder, once detonated, they would cause a chain reaction explosion and level the entire Yanjing city.</font>
story_menu_75547=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Report to the Han King, the mines in the western border have been cleared of gunpowder, and Yanjing city has been saved.</font>
story_menu_75548=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Why did the Han King change his mind? What is his intention?</font>
