storyinfo_75511=Question <a href="findnpc_new,city02,NPC_2020jq_010" style="HLStype1">Xie Ruoning's younger brother</a>
storyinfo_75512=Inquire about <a href="findnpc_new,city02,thd_010" style="HLStype1">Mahohuo</a>
storyinfo_75513=Inquire about <a href="findnpc_new,city02,NPC_2020jq_011" style="HLStype1">villagers</a>
storyinfo_75514=See if there are any discoveries about <a href="findnpc_new,city02,NPC_2020jq_012" style="HLStype1">chrysanthemums</a>
storyinfo_75515=Inform <a href="findnpc_new,city02,NPC_2020jq_007" style="HLStype1">Zhang Danxu</a>
storyinfo_75516=Find <a href="findnpc_new,city02,NPC_2020jq_013" style="HLStype1">Wen Jiang</a> to get the fragment
storyinfo_75517=Find <a href="findnpc_new,city02,NPC_2020jq_014" style="HLStype1">Hu Guan</a> to get the fragment
storyinfo_75518=Inquire about <a href="findnpc_new,city02,NPC_2020jq_007" style="HLStype1">Zhang Danxu</a>
storyinfo_75519=Inquire about <a href="findnpc_new,city04,NPC_2020jq_006" style="HLStype1">Yunyan Pavilion Master</a>
storyinfo_75520=Question <a href="findnpc_new,city04,NPC_2020jq_015" style="HLStype1">Qin Wang Mansion Guest</a>
storyinfo_75521=Listen to <a href="findnpc_new,city04,WorldNpc10554" style="HLStype1">Zhu Jing</a>
storyinfo_75522=Check with <a href="findnpc_new,city04,NPC_2020jq_016" style="HLStype1">Yunyan Pavilion Master</a>
storyinfo_75523=Listen to <a href="findnpc_new,groupscene045,NPC_2020jq_017" style="HLStype1">Zhang Danxu</a> speak
storyinfo_75524=Listen to <a href="findnpc_new,city04,NPC_2020jq_018" style="HLStype1">Zhang Danxu</a> speak
storyinfo_75525=Listen to <a href="findnpc_new,city02,WorldNpc01194" style="HLStype1">Lin Tiannan</a>'s explanation
storyinfo_75526=Find <a href="findnpc_new,city02,NPC_2020jq_019" style="HLStype1">Xie Ruoning</a>
storyinfo_75527=Tell <a href="findnpc_new,city02,WorldNpc01194" style="HLStype1">Lin Tiannan</a>.
storyinfo_75528=Go to visit <a href="findnpc_new,city02,WorldNpc01194" style="HLStype1">Lin Tiannan</a>
storyinfo_75529=Inquire with <a href="findnpc_new,city02,worldnpczybsy_jq_001" style="HLStype1">the young girl</a>
storyinfo_75530=Report to <a href="findnpc_new,city02,WorldNpc01194" style="HLStype1">Lin Tiannan</a>
storyinfo_75531=Request an audience with <a href="findnpc_new,city01,WorldNpc09081" style="HLStype1">Dongfang Cheng</a>
storyinfo_75532=Speak with <a href="findnpc_new,city01,WorldNpc09081" style="HLStype1">Dongfang Cheng</a>.
storyinfo_75533=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_003" style="HLStype1">Pu Juhan</a> for information
storyinfo_75534=Inquire with <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_004" style="HLStype1">Jiang Yibin</a>
storyinfo_75535=Inquire with <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_005" style="HLStype1">Guan Zhiqian</a>
storyinfo_75536=Pay respects to <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_006" style="HLStype1">the Han King</a>
storyinfo_75537=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_007" style="HLStype1">Xie Ruoning</a>
storyinfo_75538=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_008" style="HLStype1">Xie Ruoning</a>
storyinfo_75539=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_009" style="HLStype1">Xie Ruoning</a>
storyinfo_75540=Go to find <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_010" style="HLStype1">Mu Wei</a> to inquire
storyinfo_75541=Inform <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_009" style="HLStype1">Xie Ruoning</a>
storyinfo_75542=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_012" style="HLStype1">the man in black</a>
storyinfo_75543=Ask <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_013" style="HLStype1">the Wala people</a>
storyinfo_75544=Listen to the <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_013" style="HLStype1">Wala people</a> talk (you can enter the mine through <a href="findnpc_new,city01,eventnpcjq_2020sy_015" style="HLStype1">here</a>, and if you want to leave, you can exit through the <a href="findnpc_new,adv165,eventnpcjq_2020sy_016" style="HLStype1">mine entrance</a>)
storyinfo_75545=Inform <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_009" style="HLStype1">Xie Ruoning</a>
storyinfo_75546=Inform <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_009" style="HLStype1">Xie Ruoning</a>
storyinfo_75547=Inform the <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_006" style="HLStype1">Han king</a> (you can enter the mine through <a href="findnpc_new,city01,eventnpcjq_2020sy_017" style="HLStype1">here</a>, and if you want to leave, you can exit through the <a href="findnpc_new,adv165,eventnpcjq_2020sy_016" style="HLStype1">mine entrance</a>)
storyinfo_75548=Listen to the <a href="findnpc_new,city01,worldnpczybsy_jq_006" style="HLStype1">Han king</a> talk
storymenu_75501_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff0008" >（The Qin Emperor has always been inscrutable, with deep scheming. But now, there is a hint of a smile on his face.）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I wonder if the prince can let me guess? Perhaps you come from a secret sect...</font>
storymenu_75501_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The old prince has treated you as his own, and has devoted all his efforts to nurturing you over the years. Now, you have inherited the old prince's legacy and have become a great and virtuous emperor.</font>
storymenu_75501_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The old prince has passed away, and now you are the Qin Emperor. Everyone looks up to you. Royal blood is not the most important thing, what is important is to grasp the power in your hands, so that you can control everything and trample it under your feet.</font>
storymenu_75502_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Judging from their appearance, they are definitely not from the Central Plains. According to what the prince said earlier, the disciples of the Esoteric Buddhism should all be descendants of the Central Plains people. This is worth pondering... </font>
storymenu_75502_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I carefully observed their appearance and found many unusual features... None of the disciples had a prominent nose or large nostrils, and their faces seemed mismatched. Their eyes were also unique, with a mix of red and black eyelashes. Based on these facial features, I deduced that these disciples were from the Ku Yi tribe, a very rare race... However, my knowledge of the Ku Yi tribe is only from an ancient book and still needs to be verified...</font>
storymenu_75502_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >My lord, perhaps we can use the excuse of hosting a banquet tonight to further test them.</font>
storymenu_75503_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >May I ask if you enjoyed the Hundred Flower Dance performed by the dancers earlier?</font>
storymenu_75503_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It seems the Holy Envoy is quite pleased.</font>
storymenu_75504_1=According to ancient books, the people of Ku Yi have always only drank cold water and cannot handle the strong alcohol of the Central Plains. Additionally, the people of Ku Yi are skilled in singing and dancing, and as soon as they hear music, they cannot resist the urge to dance. At the banquet, the people of Ku Yi saw the strong alcohol and furrowed their brows. When they saw the singing and dancing, they couldn't resist, but they forced themselves to hold back, which was quite comical.
storymenu_75505_1=The wise prince, as a lesson from the chaos caused by the Five Barbarians, should be a warning for us.
storymenu_75505_2=We should use their own tactics against them, pretend to cooperate with the secret teachings, and at the same time secretly join forces with the people of the Central Plains to break the situation and protect the foundation of the Great Ming.
storymenu_75506_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Since the master has this interest, I am willing to accompany him to the end. Thanks to the master's generosity last time, I was able to win by chance. The master also generously gave away a precious green sandalwood chess set.</font>
storymenu_75506_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Even so, I cannot stay for long, master. Let's have a good game next time for three days and three nights. Goodbye!</font>
storymenu_75507_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Zhang, what kind of important matter has disturbed the leader and caused Zhang to personally intervene?</font>
storymenu_75507_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Stealing chess pieces? That's strange... What kind of chess piece is it? Have you seen it, Zhang?</font>
storymenu_75508_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will do my best to maintain unity and peace in the martial arts world.</font>
storymenu_75508_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will go now.</font>
storymenu_75509_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have the final say, and I can only agree...</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >...</font>
storymenu_75510_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, Miss, for being so straightforward and decisive. That's great.</font>
storymenu_75511_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Bilu Village? I'll go there to investigate </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >the situation.</font>
storymenu_75512_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Oh? What strange things? I've traveled around for many years and encountered many strange things. You</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >chief</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >can tell me, maybe I can help.</font>
storymenu_75512_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I'm all ears...</font>
storymenu_75512_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This seems to be a peach-colored story... It doesn't sound particularly special. Are there</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >two</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >other things?</font>
storymenu_75512_4=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Mayor</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, keep this a secret for now</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, give me some time to investigate and uncover the truth</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font>
storymenu_75513_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This...the mayor is really unreliable. In the time it takes to eat a bowl of rice, the whole village knows about it</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, and the story gets exaggerated and distorted...this is bad!</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > By making such a big fuss, the culprit will definitely run away!</font>
storymenu_75514_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This place is a bit strange.</font>
storymenu_75515_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Esoteric teachings? I wonder what their purpose is for sneaking back into the Central Plains...</font>
storymenu_75515_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >So it seems that we must gather all the pieces in order to solve this puzzle.</font>
storymenu_75516_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Sir,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >today</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I must obtain the fragments,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >this matter is of great importance, and I have no choice but to do it.</font>
storymenu_75517_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Brother Zhang</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >told me, so I ask Brother Hu to lend me the fragments for use!</font>
storymenu_75518_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff0019" >(After a moment of contemplation)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The location depicted in this picture</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >......</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >should be the Cloud Rock Pavilion outside of Luoyang.</font>
storymenu_75518_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Not bad. I have seen the gold-inlaid jade jewelry made by the Yunyan Pavilion master. The jade and gold are perfectly combined and can also act as a shock absorber. Even if dropped from a high building, it can remain unscathed. It can be said to be a masterpiece of craftsmanship, exquisite and unparalleled.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It seems that I need to visit the Yunyan Pavilion.</font>
storymenu_75519_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It seems that the master of Yunyan has already guessed it. Recently, there have been several disputes in the martial arts world over the grabbing of chess pieces. I have carefully examined the chess pieces, which are inlaid with gold and jade. The pieces are exquisitely carved, with perfect quality and flawless purity of the jade. The pieces also cleverly designed a hidden groove for fragments, and used a buffering strip on the edges to prevent collisions between the jade and gold. Such exquisite craftsmanship, I believe that only the master of Yunyan can achieve it in the world. In addition, the phrase "Yunqi does not ascend the pavilion, the rocks wear the mountains and rivers" on the completed puzzle seems to directly refer to the master of Yunyan.</font>
storymenu_75519_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you very much for informing me. I will take my leave now.</font>
storymenu_75520_1=<font face="Default" color="#ed0e49" >(It seems that I have to leave.)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Since the prince is so "persistent" in his invitation, I will go.</font>
storymenu_75521_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff070f" >(It seems that the King of Qin has been sending people to watch me...)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Well...there is no need for me to hide it, please appreciate it, Your Highness.</font>
storymenu_75522_1=The master's gestures seem to have a deeper meaning, as if he is gesturing the character "井". Could it be that the master is hinting at the well... I should go and look for the well at Yunyan Pavilion.
storymenu_75523_1=I see... Zhang, have you discovered anything?
storymenu_75523_2=Zhang, this chess game seems to have a deeper meaning... Could it be another hint...
storymenu_75524_1=Zhang, please be careful. I will take my leave.
storymenu_75525_1=I will go and find Miss Xie.
storymenu_75526_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff0a26" >（Still so domineering...go and tease her）</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Haha, let me guess, big sister, are you deliberately sending me to investigate the Murong family because you can't beat them? As for the thugs from the Salt Gang, I can take on a hundred of them, it's just like harvesting vegetables...is this your way of admitting defeat? Hehehe...</font>
storymenu_75527_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The Murong family has a residence where Japanese often come and go. Taking advantage of the dark night and strong winds, I snuck into the residence and discovered that the Japanese there were actually a secret intelligence team. They were secretly collecting a large number of maps of the Ming Dynasty, and these maps even included the terrain and feng shui annotations.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >They seem to be looking for something...</font>
storymenu_75527_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The dragon veins of the Ming Dynasty? Legend has it that the dragon veins are related to the prosperity of the country. If the dragon veins are destroyed, the foundation of the Ming Dynasty will be shaken, and the consequences will be unimaginable...</font>
storymenu_75528_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >But what happened to the Jiangnan branch of the Thunderbolt Hall?</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I don't know</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >exactly what happened?</font>
storymenu_75528_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >As far as I know, although the Thunderbolt Hall is wealthy, its disciples are not willing to work hard and practice martial arts due to their abundant family wealth. It is hard to believe that they have any intention of rebellion.</font>
storymenu_75529_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You are... the young lady of the Thunderbolt Hall?</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Come with me for now!</font>
storymenu_75530_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have hidden Miss Lei in a safe place near the restaurant.</font>
storymenu_75530_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >As entrusted by the leader, I will do my best to fulfill this task.</font>
storymenu_75531_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I would like to meet with a disciple of the Thunderbolt Hall, please</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, if it is convenient for you.</font>
storymenu_75531_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you very much.</font>
storymenu_75532_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I never imagined that there could be such an indestructible metal in this world...</font>
storymenu_75532_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I suspect there are two possibilities: either the disciple of the Thunderbolt Hall used the tyrant thunder to blow up the armory, or another force silenced them</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Unfortunately, the scene was too heavily damaged and there are no other clues besides this mask.</font>
storymenu_75533_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Where do ghosts and monsters come from in this world? I don't believe it.</font>
storymenu_75534_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I think that white rat is just a bit larger than a normal rat, not the legendary Juru.</font>
storymenu_75535_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The talk of ghosts and monsters is purely absurd.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >But I do want to learn about those demons!</font>
storymenu_75536_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The master has not yet discovered the mastermind behind the scenes. He is worried about being held accountable by the court and hopes that the lord can plead on behalf of the Dongfang Family in front of the emperor.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > </font>
storymenu_75536_2=<font face="Default" color="#ff0213" > (It seems that the King of Han has also heard about the white rat incident.) </font> <font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > Your Majesty, I have arrived in Yanjing City, it is already three in the morning. I saw a huge white shadow flash by, but the night was too dark to see clearly. It seemed to be a large white rat, about the height of a person. The people in the city are now in a state of panic, saying that this white rat is a demon and comes out to eat people every midnight. </font>
storymenu_75536_3=<font face="Default" color="#f90010" > (Divine catcher? Could it be her?) </font> <font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > Yes, I will go immediately. </font>
storymenu_75537_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" > The King of Han just mentioned sending the Six Ministries' divine catcher to investigate the white rat incident, and I guessed that the divine catcher is most likely you! Come with me! </font>
storymenu_75538_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >These people are probably very influential,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >it seems that</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >they are closely related to the explosion at the Dongfang Family.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The masks they are wearing are exactly the same as the one found by the Dongfang Family, made of a rare metal.</font>
storymenu_75538_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It seems that the mastermind behind this wants to kill and cover up their true intentions. I will go to the shops of those foreign merchants to see if there is anything suspicious.</font>
storymenu_75539_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >According to the rules, gunpowder should be strictly regulated by the court. Perhaps there is a traitor who deliberately framed</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Jiangnan</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thunderbolt Hall</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will first go to the Ministry of Justice to investigate.</font>
storymenu_75540_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >There is no time to waste, let's go quickly.</font>
storymenu_75541_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will go to a few city gates to take a look.</font>
storymenu_75542_1=<font face="Default" color="#f90723" >(Looking around)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Okay.</font>
storymenu_75543_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Your filial piety is truly touching. I will definitely help His Highness find the remains of his ancestors.</font>
storymenu_75543_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >As entrusted by Your Grace, I am more than willing to do so.</font>
storymenu_75544_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you for informing me, Your Highness. We will meet again in the future.</font>
storymenu_75545_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It seems that Li Guangming is a "big fish". I will secretly investigate him.</font>
storymenu_75546_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's urgent, I will first rush to the mine in Zijin Ridge to stop the explosion of gunpowder.</font>
storymenu_75547_1=<font face="Default" color="#fc052a" >(Oh no, it seems that the Han King already knows my identity.)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The Lord is skilled in both strategy and martial arts,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >and I am unable to predict.</font>
storymenu_75547_2=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I only wish for peace in the world,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >with no one harmed.</font>
storymenu_75547_3=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >What does the Han King mean by this?</font>
storymenu_75548_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I am grateful for the Han King's kindness, and I will always remember it.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will definitely uncover the truth and clear my name.</font>
useiteminfo_75501=Synthesize the fragments in the <a href="TASK_ITEM,item_2020jq_001" style="HLStype1">chess piece</a>

